Feature: Incompleteness-driven discovery and OODA feedback
  The current calculus is expected to have a boundary. Laplace locates constrained
  vacancies, proposes testable extensions, and observes outcomes without declaring a
  predicted occupant witnessed or using its own ancestry as independent support.

  Scenario: A constrained vacancy is deeper than an empty query result
    Given repeated typed motifs agree on containment, roles, order, geometry, time, and independently supported consequences
    And one motif has no sufficiently supported occupant for one role
    When the fray detector calculates the vacancy
    Then it emits the missing role and predicted physical, relational, temporal, and counterfactual signature
    And an unrelated zero-row query does not emit the same discovery signal

  Scenario Outline: Discovery candidates retain their extension kind
    Given a persistent typed fray cannot be explained by the current calculus
    When the Godel engine proposes a candidate <kind>
    Then the candidate names the current calculus version, vacancy signature, generated predictions, fitting boundary, evaluation boundary, counterexample program, complexity, and expected observations
    And it remains a derived hypothesis rather than witnessed reality

    Examples:
      | kind |
      | entity |
      | physicality |
      | relation |
      | relation family |
      | motif |
      | law |
      | operator |
      | firmware operation |
      | cognition program |

  Scenario: Predicted occupant does not fill its own vacancy
    Given a candidate satisfies every surrounding structural constraint and improves unchanged evaluation evidence
    When no eligible observation or testimony has witnessed an occupant
    Then the vacancy remains epistemically unfilled
    And the candidate retains predicted and derived status
    And treating structural implication as observation fails epistemic-kind separation

  Scenario: Candidate extensions must explain evidence they did not manufacture
    Given generation, fitting, evaluation, and counterexample boundaries are independently content addressed
    When a candidate extension is fitted and evaluated
    Then its value is held-out explanatory improvement minus declared complexity
    And evaluation leakage makes the experiment fail
    And a candidate that only improves its fitting objective is rejected

  Scenario: A self-generated extension cannot corroborate itself
    Given one candidate rule produces one thousand derived predictions about Laplace
    When dependence-aware adjudication evaluates their support
    Then all descendants retain the candidate and its root observations in their ancestry
    And they contribute no new independent root merely because Laplace generated them
    And separate observed outcomes remain distinguishable from those predictions

  @LP-TEST-GODEL-SELF-AUTHORED-STRUCTURE @LP-TEST-GODEL-NOVELTY-NONAGENCY
  Scenario: A synthesized recipe makes self-authorship an auditable provenance fact
    Given no active or supplied recipe can produce a required typed structure
    And a constrained vacancy predicts a candidate recipe and result contract
    When Laplace synthesizes the candidate tests disjoint evidence and counterexamples receives activation and produces the structure
    Then the receipt distinguishes supplied recipes from the synthesized recipe
    And it names reused subtrees novel subtrees generation fitting evaluation activation and observed outcome boundaries
    And usefulness requires the declared held-out and task-completion evidence
    But novelty alone establishes neither independent agency consciousness subjective experience nor personhood

  Scenario: A discovered counterexample preserves its epistemic layer
    Given a persistent contradiction or failed prediction implicates one proposition
    When the Godel engine generates and executes a counterexample experiment
    Then the generated refutation begins as a derived refutation hypothesis
    And an external observed outcome is retained as a witnessed negative attestation
    And a deterministic counter-calculation is retained as calculated contradiction evidence with its program inputs and receipt
    And the calculated result never impersonates a witness
    And a chained conclusion remains a derived refutation hypothesis with complete root lineage
    And only eligible independent observations contribute new independent witness roots
    And adjudication can lower or refute the proposition without deleting it

  Scenario: Accepted calculus extension preserves earlier replay
    Given calculus version C1 has accepted programs and receipts
    And an independently tested candidate produces calculus version C2
    When programs are replayed as of C1 and C2
    Then C1 reproduces its historical results under its original contracts
    And C2 exposes every changed type, law, operator, result, and dependent artifact
    And neither version claims final completeness

  Scenario: OODA returns action consequence as universal observation
    Given a pinned substrate, goal, cognition program, firmware, and effect envelope
    When Laplace observes, orients, decides, acts, and observes the consequence
    Then exact structure and attributable claims remain distinct during observation
    And orientation receipts the generated measurements, indexed search, operator, field, and defects
    And decision evaluates isolated acts before choosing one
    And the effect outcome reenters through content, physicality, occurrence, testimony, and receipt layers
    And replay reproduces every stage and state transition

  Scenario: Fast cognition learning and Godel discovery cannot impersonate one another
    Given one query completes under the current calculus
    And new testimony later changes standing
    And a persistent fray later proposes a new relation law
    When the three transitions are inspected
    Then the query changes neither evidence epoch nor calculus version
    And adjudication changes evidence epoch without silently changing the relation law
    And discovery changes no active calculus until its experiment and activation contract pass
